# Druid of the Spade (2/3, {2}{G}): "As long as you control a token, this creature gets +2/+0 and has trample." Five Moxen cast
# on turn 1 are nonlegendary permanents but not tokens: with them and the Druid out it is a plain 2/3 without trample. Gold Pan
# (two mana, "When this Equipment enters, create a Treasure token") makes a token: now the Druid is 4/3 with trample (CR 604.1,
# 613.4c, 111.1). Sacrificing the Treasure for its mana takes the token away and the Druid is a plain 2/3 again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
